BUG B8 (cli.py): a failed save gives the user NO feedback at all
==========================================================================
(See DEBUGGING_LOG.md — reproduced via code walkthrough: the
 `except StorageError: pass` block prints nothing on failure,
 and the success message in the `else` clause is skipped too,
 so the user sees no output and wrongly assumes nothing happened
 rather than being told their change was lost.)
